{
    "word": "cassiopeia",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "dc98893e-284f-3f0b-8056-33f2c37180bb",
                "word": "Cassiopeia",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6af649ce-71b8-334a-b950-2cde5cd3bc1d",
                        "entry_id": "dc98893e-284f-3f0b-8056-33f2c37180bb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Proud wife of Cepheus and mother of Andromeda, queen of Ethiopia. When she boasted that her beauty was equal to that of the Nereids, she was punished by Poseidon."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Greek"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "89327b01-e403-3c1f-920d-8cfd0056962c",
                        "entry_id": "dc98893e-284f-3f0b-8056-33f2c37180bb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A circumpolar constellation of the northern sky representing Queen Cassiopeia from Greek myth, lying between the constellations Cepheus and Perseus."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f2f314fc-b3b4-4d74-840d-20a04a060bc4",
                        "source_entry_id": "dc98893e-284f-3f0b-8056-33f2c37180bb",
                        "source_sense_description": "mythical wife of Cepheus",
                        "target_lang_word": "Cassiopée",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Cassiopée",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "119dd859-0ba8-3831-b3c2-9f5dad0f052b",
                                        "entry_id": "05f78582-0d74-347e-8c41-7eab9a610952",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Constellation de l’hémisphère nord, facilement reconnaissable grâce à sa forme de W. Elle est bordée par Céphée, le Lézard, Andromède, Persée et la Girafe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f56c8653-0d37-43b0-a896-962077d9d976",
                                                "sense_id": "119dd859-0ba8-3831-b3c2-9f5dad0f052b",
                                                "text": "Au-dessus de moi, les nuages chassent en désordre avec une extrême rapidité, et quelques constellations étincellent à travers leurs déchirures, ici Cassiopée, la Petite Ourse dans le nord, au zénith, Véga de la Lyre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b90a926-a382-452d-8ea2-fc21814b421e",
                                                "sense_id": "119dd859-0ba8-3831-b3c2-9f5dad0f052b",
                                                "text": "Un instant, ils se turent, sans un mouvement, les regards perdus parmi les milliards de mondes, qui luisaient au ciel sombre. Une étoile filante traversa d’un trait de flamme la constellation de Cassiopée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Cassiopée",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1cce8e06-2b23-3019-a06d-595986962c8f",
                                        "entry_id": "b219c767-f24c-312e-b088-3871df14f086",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prénom féminin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a3b2d76-7cc2-4c63-b7b6-02c5779221de",
                                                "sense_id": "1cce8e06-2b23-3019-a06d-595986962c8f",
                                                "text": "Bon, alors tu as peut-être déjà rencontré ma cousine Cassiopée, dans ce cas."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
